RUNG 1 — ids: [left, right] in, [left, id, right] out
  A pile leaves each line's id unsaid (it is a hash of the two ends). References point at
  ids, so this is the first thing any reader needs.

  usage:  1-ids FILE.eoe ...

for each line in (read pile):
    print [left, hash(left, right), right]
